<title>SWITZERLAND: Credit Suisse Swiss franc forex rate forecasts.</title>
<headline>Credit Suisse Swiss franc forex rate forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse gave these forecasts for Swiss franc foreign exchange rates:</p>
<p>		 End Dec 1996  one-month  three-month  12-month</p>
<p> DM		86.00	    85	    85	    83</p>
<p> US$	     1.340	   1.32	  1.32	  1.23</p>
<p> YEN	     1.165	   1.18	  1.18	  1.12</p>
<p> CAN$	    0.978	   0.98	  1.00	  0.94</p>
<p> ECU	     1.686	   1.62	  1.61	  1.57</p>
<p> GBP	     2.238	   2.17	  2.11	  2.03</p>
<p> HFL	     76.79	   75.9	  75.9	  74.1</p>
<p> FRF	     25.52	   25.1	  25.0	  24.4</p>
<p> ITL	     0.880	   0.85	  0.85	  0.81</p>
<p> PTA	     1.020	   1.01	  1.01	  0.98</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
